# Markdown files are read byte-for-byte by .claude/tests/context-budget.test.mjs (the ccf-budget
# self-consistency check) and by prompt-standard.md's own byte-count invariant. On a Windows
# checkout with the default core.autocrlf=true, git would rewrite LF to CRLF on checkout, changing
# every Buffer.byteLength measurement without changing the content — normalize to LF instead.
*.md text eol=lf
